NOTE ON THE PROJECT-WIDE "ANSATZ PRESERVATION" CONDITION

The parent research programme carries, in its own repository, an additional
condition named "Ansatz Preservation" (field-first ontology, handle minimality,
dynamics axiom). It is NOT applied to this deposit, for two independent reasons,
and the decision is recorded here rather than left silent:

  1. Scope. This paper contains no physical reading of any object whatsoever
     (stated in §6): the word "timelike" is used only for the sign of a
     quadratic form, and signature (3,1) enters only as an arithmetic condition. The three ansatz clauses speak about fields, particles
     and dynamics, and therefore have no subject matter in this text.

  2. Licence integrity. CC BY 4.0 forbids applying legal terms that restrict
     others from doing anything the licence permits; a licence carrying an extra
     condition would no longer be CC BY 4.0. The preceding deposit of this series
     (Zenodo 10.5281/zenodo.22068307) resolved the same question the same way.

If the author decides otherwise, this file is the single place to change.
